    "detailed_description": "Cut Cut Buffet is a slicing simulator for the ages, cut your way through mounds of food and multiple game modes. Can you stand the heat of the kitchen?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 3 game modes with more on the way<br />\r\n- 2 difficulties per mode<br />\r\n- Realistic cutting mechanic<br />\r\n- Cut all kinds of foods<br />\r\n- Fish<br />\r\n- Immersive restaurant environment<br />\r\n- Multiple Weapons<br />\r\n- Developer updates<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Modes: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. Survival Mode - Cut as long as possible and avoid the bombs<br />\r\n2. Time Mode - Cut as much as possible while avoiding bombs<br />\r\n3. Practice Mode - Hone your skills in a relaxed infinite setting",
